<AtTheTable>

Count without replacement. Separate the event “someone holds an ace” from the event “someone beats you.”

</AtTheTable>

<QuantCorner>

Finite inventories appear in sampling without replacement outside poker too. Conditioning on items already observed changes the population, not merely the final display.

</QuantCorner>
